<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mise à Jour Réussie</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f0f0f0;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            height: 100vh;
            background-image: url('https://example.com/sky-background.jpg'); /* Remplacez par une image de fond appropriée */
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            color: #333;
        }
        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 3em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }
        p {
            font-size: 1.2em;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0 20px;
            max-width: 600px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }
        .container {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            text-align: center;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }
        a {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 20px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #007BFF;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            border: 2px solid #007BFF;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-size: 1.1em;
            transition: background-color 0.3s, transform 0.2s;
        }
        a:hover {
            background-color: #007BFF;
            color: white;
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            h1 {
                font-size: 2.5em;
            }
            p {
                font-size: 1em;
            }
            a {
                padding: 10px 20px;
                font-size: 1em;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Mise à Jour Réussie</h1>
        <p>Le vol a été mis à jour avec succès. Merci de votre patience.</p>
        <a href="vols">Retourner aux Vols</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>